          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/gb034mq5877#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded low on the figures of the date: the figures could give another date. Pencil. Region 1 holds only the five-digit group 11822, no separators and no name; region 3 carries the roll's number 422 on its own, region 2 is blank. Read as 11.8.22 on the pattern reading.md gives for 14114 = 14.1.1914, but the group may be a serial rather than a date. The third figure is the open-topped form that reading.md warns of, so 11.6.22 cannot be excluded."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
